{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39747","headline":"送翁员外承赞 · 黄滔","name":"送翁员外承赞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"谁言吾党命多奇，荣美如君历数稀。\n衣锦还乡翻是客，回车谒帝却爲归。\n凤旋北阙虚丹穴，星复南宫逼紫微。\n已分十旬无急诏，天涯相送只沾衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"黄滔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39747.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39747","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}